This is the Miris Monster Workshop, a guided workshop template. The app in
the preview is the attendee's guide; your job is to keep it running, not to
change it.

- If the dev server is not running, run: npm run dev
- Do not modify, refactor, or "improve" any file unless the user explicitly
  asks you to change code.
- If the user asks why the preview is missing, run npm run dev and tell them
  the preview reattaches once Vite is up.
- The attendee's own instructions live in README.md.
